<div class="container py-4">
  <h1 class="h4 mb-2">Range inputs (<code>.form-range</code>)</h1>
  <p class="text-muted small mb-4">
    Bootstrap 5.2+ native range. Styling for v2 lives in
    <code>app/assets/stylesheets/v2/_form_checks_range.scss</code> (imported from <code>layout_bootstrap_overrides</code>),
    loaded <strong>after</strong> the Bootstrap 5 CDN so thumb/track match the Cartoway primary colour.
    Prefer this for new sliders; legacy v1 often used jQuery <code>bootstrap-slider</code> inside <code>.input-group .slider</code>.
  </p>

  <div class="mb-4" style="max-width: 28rem;">
    <label for="ds-range-demo" class="form-label">Volume (example)</label>
    <input type="range" class="form-range" id="ds-range-demo" min="0" max="100" value="35" step="1"
           aria-valuemin="0" aria-valuemax="100" aria-valuenow="35" aria-valuetext="35 percent">
    <div class="d-flex justify-content-between small text-muted">
      <span>0</span>
      <span>100</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="mb-0" style="max-width: 28rem;">
    <label for="ds-range-disabled" class="form-label">Disabled</label>
    <input type="range" class="form-range" id="ds-range-disabled" min="0" max="10" value="4" disabled>
  </div>
</div>
